# Build context of apps/control-plane/Dockerfile (BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore): only
# what the image is built from. Every workspace manifest is in, so the lockfile matches the
# workspace; the sources are those of the Control Plane, its web app and the packages they use.
*
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!.npmrc
!tsconfig.base.json
!apps/*/package.json
!packages/*/package.json
!infra/*/package.json
!apps/control-plane
!apps/control-plane-web
!packages/config
!packages/contracts
!packages/design-tokens
!packages/domain
!packages/error-reporting
!packages/i18n
!packages/licensing
!packages/totp
!packages/ui-web

# Never: installed or built output, local secrets and data, test output.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.turbo
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/storybook-static
apps/control-plane/src/generated
apps/control-plane/.cloud-backups
